# IDM batch (0.3.9): from fm1-build-status.md. Braindance's hats, tom and claves are rewritten by the polymeter
# (SFX_POLY in gen.c), which loops each at its own length; the rows below are the design's first 16 steps.

style REPHLEX
kick     X... ..x. ..x. ....
snare    .... X... .... X.o.
chat     x.xx .x.x x.x. x.xx
tom      x..x ..x. ..x. .x..
claves   x.x. x..x .x.x ..x.
